{"id":"cbc1735835617989","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-categorical-resolutions.md","title":"Categorical Resolutions and Derived Values","display":"df-categorical-resolutions — Categorical Resolutions and Derived Values","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-categorical-resolutions","aliases":["58-df-categorical-resolutions"],"display":"df-categorical-resolutions — Categorical Resolutions and Derived Values","depends_on":["[[58-df-abelian-category.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-categorical-resolutions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-categorical-resolutions</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-categorical-resolutions — Categorical Resolutions and Derived Values"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" href=\"?note=2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" title=\"58-df-abelian-category.md\">58-df-abelian-category.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-functor.md\">../batch18/58-df-functor.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,Q,I,d,\\partial,\\varepsilon,A,D,H,n,F,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,\\mathcal C\\in V\">\\(P,Q,I,d,\\partial,\\varepsilon,A,D,H,n,F,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,\\mathcal C\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_+=\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(\\omega_+=\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对每个已满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\)</span> 的范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)=\\mathrm{CatHom}_S(\\mathcal C,X,Y)\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)=\\mathrm{CatHom}_S(\\mathcal C,X,Y)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_{\\mathcal C}(f)=\\mathrm{CatDomain}_S(\\mathcal C,f)\">\\(s_{\\mathcal C}(f)=\\mathrm{CatDomain}_S(\\mathcal C,f)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_{\\mathcal C}(f)=\\mathrm{CatCodomain}_S(\\mathcal C,f)\">\\(t_{\\mathcal C}(f)=\\mathrm{CatCodomain}_S(\\mathcal C,f)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"gf=\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S(\\mathcal C,g,f)\">\\(gf=\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S(\\mathcal C,g,f)\\)</span>；复合所属范畴由同一公式中的箭头类型确定。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_0=\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S(F)\">\\(F_0=\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S(F)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_1=\\mathrm{FunctorArrows}_S(F)\">\\(F_1=\\mathrm{FunctorArrows}_S(F)\\)</span>，只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\)</span> 下取值。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>链复形微分 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(n):P(n)\\to P(n-1)\">\\(d(n):P(n)\\to P(n-1)\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_+\">\\(\\omega_+\\)</span>；上链复形微分 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(n):I(n)\\to I(n+1)\">\\(d(n):I(n)\\to I(n+1)\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>。两种方向不共享不明的下标约定。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProjectiveObjectIn}_S,\\mathrm{InjectiveObjectIn}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ProjectiveObjectIn}_S,\\mathrm{InjectiveObjectIn}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EnoughProjectives}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{EnoughProjectives}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AdditiveFunctor}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{AdditiveFunctor}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>；其余谓词的参数依下面各等价式的左端确定。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}\">\\(\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CokernelIn}\">\\(\\mathrm{CokernelIn}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EpimorphismIn}\">\\(\\mathrm{EpimorphismIn}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExactPairIn}\">\\(\\mathrm{ExactPairIn}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HomAdditionData}\">\\(\\mathrm{HomAdditionData}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsomorphicObject}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsomorphicObject}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KernelIn}\">\\(\\mathrm{KernelIn}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MonomorphismIn}\">\\(\\mathrm{MonomorphismIn}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" href=\"?note=2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" title=\"58-df-abelian-category.md\">58-df-abelian-category.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ChainComplexIn}\">\\(\\mathrm{ChainComplexIn}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CochainComplexIn}\">\\(\\mathrm{CochainComplexIn}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CohomologyObjectIn}\">\\(\\mathrm{CohomologyObjectIn}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HomologyObject}\">\\(\\mathrm{HomologyObject}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ImageCochainComplex}\">\\(\\mathrm{ImageCochainComplex}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ImageComplex}\">\\(\\mathrm{ImageComplex}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InjectiveResolutionIn}\">\\(\\mathrm{InjectiveResolutionIn}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftExactFunctorIn}\">\\(\\mathrm{LeftExactFunctorIn}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolutionIn}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolutionIn}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RightDerivedValue}\">\\(\\mathrm{RightDerivedValue}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}object\\text{-}in}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveObjectIn}_S(P,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{EpimorphismIn}_S(f,\\mathcal C)\\to\n\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(P,t_{\\mathcal C}(f))\\;\n\\exists v\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(P,s_{\\mathcal C}(f))\\;(fv=u)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}object\\text{-}in}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveObjectIn}_S(P,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{EpimorphismIn}_S(f,\\mathcal C)\\to\n\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(P,t_{\\mathcal C}(f))\\;\n\\exists v\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(P,s_{\\mathcal C}(f))\\;(fv=u)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}injective\\text{-}object\\text{-}in}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{InjectiveObjectIn}_S(I,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MonomorphismIn}_S(f,\\mathcal C)\\to\n\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(s_{\\mathcal C}(f),I)\\;\n\\exists v\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(t_{\\mathcal C}(f),I)\\;(vf=u)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}injective\\text{-}object\\text{-}in}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{InjectiveObjectIn}_S(I,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MonomorphismIn}_S(f,\\mathcal C)\\to\n\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(s_{\\mathcal C}(f),I)\\;\n\\exists v\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(t_{\\mathcal C}(f),I)\\;(vf=u)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}enough\\text{-}projectives}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EnoughProjectives}_S(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\exists P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\exists e\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(P,A)\\;\n(\\mathrm{ProjectiveObjectIn}_S(P,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{EpimorphismIn}_S(e,\\mathcal C)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}enough\\text{-}projectives}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EnoughProjectives}_S(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\exists P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\exists e\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(P,A)\\;\n(\\mathrm{ProjectiveObjectIn}_S(P,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{EpimorphismIn}_S(e,\\mathcal C)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}additive\\text{-}functor}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{AdditiveFunctor}_S(F,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\mathfrak a,\\mathfrak b\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{HomAdditionData}_S(\\mathfrak a,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{HomAdditionData}_S(\\mathfrak b,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal A)\\;\n\\forall f,g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(X,Y)\\;\\Bigl(\nF_1(\\mathfrak a(\\langle X,Y\\rangle)(\\langle f,g\\rangle))\n=\\mathfrak b(\\langle F_0(X),F_0(Y)\\rangle)(\\langle F_1(f),F_1(g)\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}additive\\text{-}functor}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{AdditiveFunctor}_S(F,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\mathfrak a,\\mathfrak b\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{HomAdditionData}_S(\\mathfrak a,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{HomAdditionData}_S(\\mathfrak b,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal A)\\;\n\\forall f,g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(X,Y)\\;\\Bigl(\nF_1(\\mathfrak a(\\langle X,Y\\rangle)(\\langle f,g\\rangle))\n=\\mathfrak b(\\langle F_0(X),F_0(Y)\\rangle)(\\langle F_1(f),F_1(g)\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chain\\text{-}complex\\text{-}in}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ChainComplexIn}_S(P,d,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(P,\\omega,\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(d,\\omega_+,\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega_+\\;\\Bigl(\nd(n)\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(P(n),P(n-1))\n\\land\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}_S(d(n)d(n+1),P(n+1),P(n-1),\\mathcal C)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chain\\text{-}complex\\text{-}in}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ChainComplexIn}_S(P,d,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(P,\\omega,\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(d,\\omega_+,\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega_+\\;\\Bigl(\nd(n)\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(P(n),P(n-1))\n\\land\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}_S(d(n)d(n+1),P(n+1),P(n-1),\\mathcal C)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cochain\\text{-}complex\\text{-}in}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CochainComplexIn}_S(I,d,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(I,\\omega,\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(d,\\omega,\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\nd(n)\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(I(n),I(n+1))\n\\land\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}_S(d(n+1)d(n),I(n),I(n+2),\\mathcal C)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cochain\\text{-}complex\\text{-}in}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CochainComplexIn}_S(I,d,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(I,\\omega,\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(d,\\omega,\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\nd(n)\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(I(n),I(n+1))\n\\land\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}_S(d(n+1)d(n),I(n),I(n+2),\\mathcal C)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}resolution\\text{-}in}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolutionIn}_S(P,d,\\varepsilon,A,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ChainComplexIn}_S(P,d,\\mathcal C)\\land A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\varepsilon\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(P(0),A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{EpimorphismIn}_S(\\varepsilon,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{ExactPairIn}_S(d(1),\\varepsilon,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ProjectiveObjectIn}_S(P(n),\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega_+\\;\\mathrm{ExactPairIn}_S(d(n+1),d(n),\\mathcal C).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}resolution\\text{-}in}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolutionIn}_S(P,d,\\varepsilon,A,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ChainComplexIn}_S(P,d,\\mathcal C)\\land A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\varepsilon\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(P(0),A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{EpimorphismIn}_S(\\varepsilon,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{ExactPairIn}_S(d(1),\\varepsilon,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ProjectiveObjectIn}_S(P(n),\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega_+\\;\\mathrm{ExactPairIn}_S(d(n+1),d(n),\\mathcal C).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}injective\\text{-}resolution\\text{-}in}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{InjectiveResolutionIn}_S(I,d,\\varepsilon,A,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CochainComplexIn}_S(I,d,\\mathcal C)\\land A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\varepsilon\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,I(0))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{MonomorphismIn}_S(\\varepsilon,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{ExactPairIn}_S(\\varepsilon,d(0),\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{InjectiveObjectIn}_S(I(n),\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ExactPairIn}_S(d(n),d(n+1),\\mathcal C).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}injective\\text{-}resolution\\text{-}in}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{InjectiveResolutionIn}_S(I,d,\\varepsilon,A,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CochainComplexIn}_S(I,d,\\mathcal C)\\land A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\varepsilon\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,I(0))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{MonomorphismIn}_S(\\varepsilon,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{ExactPairIn}_S(\\varepsilon,d(0),\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{InjectiveObjectIn}_S(I(n),\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ExactPairIn}_S(d(n),d(n+1),\\mathcal C).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}image\\text{-}chain\\text{-}complex}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ImageComplex}_S(Q,\\partial,F,P,d,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{ChainComplexIn}_S(P,d,\\mathcal A)\n\\land\\mathrm{ChainComplexIn}_S(Q,\\partial,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(Q(n)=F_0(P(n)))\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega_+\\;(\\partial(n)=F_1(d(n))).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}image\\text{-}chain\\text{-}complex}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ImageComplex}_S(Q,\\partial,F,P,d,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{ChainComplexIn}_S(P,d,\\mathcal A)\n\\land\\mathrm{ChainComplexIn}_S(Q,\\partial,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(Q(n)=F_0(P(n)))\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega_+\\;(\\partial(n)=F_1(d(n))).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}image\\text{-}cochain\\text{-}complex}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ImageCochainComplex}_S(Q,\\partial,F,I,d,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{CochainComplexIn}_S(I,d,\\mathcal A)\n\\land\\mathrm{CochainComplexIn}_S(Q,\\partial,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(Q(n)=F_0(I(n))\\land\\partial(n)=F_1(d(n))).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}image\\text{-}cochain\\text{-}complex}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ImageCochainComplex}_S(Q,\\partial,F,I,d,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{CochainComplexIn}_S(I,d,\\mathcal A)\n\\land\\mathrm{CochainComplexIn}_S(Q,\\partial,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(Q(n)=F_0(I(n))\\land\\partial(n)=F_1(d(n))).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homology\\text{-}object}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HomologyObject}_S(H,n,Q,d,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ChainComplexIn}_S(Q,d,\\mathcal C)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land H\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Bigl[(n=0\\land\\exists q\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n(\\mathrm{CokernelIn}_S(q,d(1),\\mathcal C)\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(q)=H))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor(n&gt;0\\land\\exists k,b,q\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{KernelIn}_S(k,d(n),\\mathcal C)\n\\land b\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(Q(n+1),s_{\\mathcal C}(k))\n\\land kb=d(n+1)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{38mm}\\land\\mathrm{CokernelIn}_S(q,b,\\mathcal C)\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(q)=H\\Bigr))\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homology\\text{-}object}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HomologyObject}_S(H,n,Q,d,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ChainComplexIn}_S(Q,d,\\mathcal C)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land H\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Bigl[(n=0\\land\\exists q\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n(\\mathrm{CokernelIn}_S(q,d(1),\\mathcal C)\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(q)=H))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor(n&gt;0\\land\\exists k,b,q\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{KernelIn}_S(k,d(n),\\mathcal C)\n\\land b\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(Q(n+1),s_{\\mathcal C}(k))\n\\land kb=d(n+1)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{38mm}\\land\\mathrm{CokernelIn}_S(q,b,\\mathcal C)\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(q)=H\\Bigr))\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cohomology\\text{-}object\\text{-}in}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CohomologyObjectIn}_S(H,n,Q,d,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CochainComplexIn}_S(Q,d,\\mathcal C)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land H\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists k\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{KernelIn}_S(k,d(n),\\mathcal C)\\land\\Bigl[\n(n=0\\land s_{\\mathcal C}(k)=H)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor(n&gt;0\\land\\exists b,q\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl(\nb\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(Q(n-1),s_{\\mathcal C}(k))\\land kb=d(n-1)\n\\land\\mathrm{CokernelIn}_S(q,b,\\mathcal C)\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(q)=H\\Bigr))\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cohomology\\text{-}object\\text{-}in}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CohomologyObjectIn}_S(H,n,Q,d,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CochainComplexIn}_S(Q,d,\\mathcal C)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land H\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists k\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{KernelIn}_S(k,d(n),\\mathcal C)\\land\\Bigl[\n(n=0\\land s_{\\mathcal C}(k)=H)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor(n&gt;0\\land\\exists b,q\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl(\nb\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(Q(n-1),s_{\\mathcal C}(k))\\land kb=d(n-1)\n\\land\\mathrm{CokernelIn}_S(q,b,\\mathcal C)\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(q)=H\\Bigr))\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}right\\text{-}derived\\text{-}value}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{RightDerivedValue}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(D,F,A,n,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{AdditiveFunctor}_S(F,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal A)\\land D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal B)\\land n\\in\\omega\n\\land\\exists I,d,\\varepsilon,Q,\\partial,H\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{InjectiveResolutionIn}_S(I,d,\\varepsilon,A,\\mathcal A)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{ImageCochainComplex}_S(Q,\\partial,F,I,d,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{CohomologyObjectIn}_S(H,n,Q,\\partial,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{IsomorphicObject}_S(D,H,\\mathcal B)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}right\\text{-}derived\\text{-}value}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{RightDerivedValue}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(D,F,A,n,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{AdditiveFunctor}_S(F,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal A)\\land D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal B)\\land n\\in\\omega\n\\land\\exists I,d,\\varepsilon,Q,\\partial,H\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{InjectiveResolutionIn}_S(I,d,\\varepsilon,A,\\mathcal A)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{ImageCochainComplex}_S(Q,\\partial,F,I,d,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{CohomologyObjectIn}_S(H,n,Q,\\partial,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{IsomorphicObject}_S(D,H,\\mathcal B)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}left\\text{-}exact\\text{-}functor\\text{-}in}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LeftExactFunctorIn}_S(F,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{AdditiveFunctor}_S(F,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k,f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal A)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{KernelIn}_S(k,f,\\mathcal A)\\to\n\\mathrm{KernelIn}_S(\\mathrm{FunctorArrows}_S(F)(k),\\mathrm{FunctorArrows}_S(F)(f),\\mathcal B)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}left\\text{-}exact\\text{-}functor\\text{-}in}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LeftExactFunctorIn}_S(F,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{AdditiveFunctor}_S(F,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k,f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal A)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{KernelIn}_S(k,f,\\mathcal A)\\to\n\\mathrm{KernelIn}_S(\\mathrm{FunctorArrows}_S(F)(k),\\mathrm{FunctorArrows}_S(F)(f),\\mathcal B)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>五元范畴投射分解接口与书中五元模投射分解接口保持区分；没有把一般阿贝尔范畴缩小到模范畴。</li>\n<li>右导出值只在相应对象实际具有内射分解时成立；公式没有凭空假定所有给定的小范畴都具有足够内射对象。</li>\n<li>输出按同构关系定义，而不是声称不同分解得到严格相同的集合。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-abelian-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"2aed7ac2ed3313e0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-abelian-category.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-functor.md","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-abelian-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"2aed7ac2ed3313e0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}$、$\\mathrm{CokernelIn}$、$\\mathrm{EpimorphismIn}$、$\\mathrm{ExactPairIn}$、$\\mathrm{HomAdditionData}$、$\\mathrm{IsomorphicObject}$、$\\mathrm{KernelIn}$、$\\mathrm{MonomorphismIn}$、$\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}$ 取 [[58-df-abelian-category.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,Q,I,d,\\partial,\\varepsilon,A,D,H,n,F,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,\\mathcal C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_+=\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\